  description: An empty glass liquor bottle documented as a potential scene item.
  foundLocation: On the rear ground-floor kitchen counter.
  observedCondition: The bottle was empty and visibly intact. Its exterior was suitable
    for latent-print processing.
  investigativeContext: The bottle provides context for the earlier drinking gathering
    and may corroborate handling or presence. It does not establish who was present
    when John was attacked or who caused the attack.
